# oc-sim scenario v1
# MELODY's steps edited on the screen (journal/D-047): launched as in
# melody.scn, three clocks on TR1, then the left switch enters the sequence
# (EDIT in the title), the left encoder moves to the fifth step, framed, and
# the right encoder raises its note three degrees of the scale, which the
# title names.
